'''Chroma Lightbringer''' is a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] gun that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Mystery Box 2]] or through trading. 

== Appearance ==
Unlike most guns, the Chroma Lightbringer is not a revolver, although it looks and sounds like one. The whole gun is a pathbringer, and white in color. The handle has a colored grip. The barrel also has colored stripes. There is a "wing" in the top right/ top left corner of the gun (depending on where you look at it from) this element is also colored. The trigger is also colored, but the cover of the trigger is white. The wing, barrel, trigger and main body of the gun alternate in rainbow colors.  

== Trivia ==
*It is the chroma counterpart of the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun under the name [[Lightbringer]], which can be found in the same box.
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].
*It was released along with the [[Season 1]] update.
*Like many other [[Chroma Weapons]], it was a victim of [[The Duping Glitch (2021)|the Duping Glitch (2021)]].
*It is part of a set with the chroma gun [[Chroma Darkbringer]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Chroma Bringer Set|Chroma Bringer Set]].
*Like all the other [[Chroma Weapons]], it is not salvageable in the crafting station.

